---
import BrandMark from './BrandMark.astro';
---

<figure class="water-graphic">
  <div class="water-graphic-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <BrandMark class="hero-brand-mark" labelled={true} title="Logo Penapis Air Kesihatan" />
  <figcaption>
    <strong>Penapis Air</strong>
    <span>Kesihatan</span>
    <small>Jualan · Servis · Filter gantian</small>
  </figcaption>
  <div class="graphic-note">
    <span>01</span>
    <p>Beritahu model, masalah dan lokasi. Kami semak dahulu sebelum mencadangkan langkah seterusnya.</p>
  </div>
</figure>
